      "title": "先拆兩動詞",
      "content": "Read and answer 含 read、answer 兩步，先寫成清單。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ENG_R4_U02_ENG_R4_S009_SEC_2",
      "title": "then 表明顯先後",
      "content": "Underline, then compare：先劃線後比較。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ENG_R4_U02_ENG_R4_S009_SEC_3",
      "title": "before/after 決定方向",
      "content": "Before you write, discuss 表 discuss 先；after reading, close 表 read 先。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ENG_R4_U02_ENG_R4_S009_SEC_4",
      "title": "and 不一定可交換",
      "content": "Open the file and type your name 通常需先開檔才可輸入，事件條件也能排序。"
    }
